       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- ] <i>More,</i> or <i>most surpassing,</i> or <i>excelling:</i> so in the saying, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ أَغْمَرُهُمْ</span>
